{%- comment -%}
COUNTRIES STRIP — "Where is Living Earth?"
Data lives in _data/countries.yml (title, url, image).
If a country has no image set yet, a placeholder letter badge shows instead
so the section still works before real shape assets are ready.

id="countries" added so this section can be jumped to directly
(e.g. from the Quick Links "Countries" link: /#countries)
{%- endcomment -%}
<section id="countries" class="countries-strip">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="countries-strip-heading">Where is Living Earth?</h2>
    <div class="countries-strip-row">
      {% for c in site.data.countries %}
        <a class="countries-strip-item" href="{% if c.url contains 'http' %}{{ c.url }}{% else %}{{ c.url | relative_url }}{% endif %}">
          <span class="countries-strip-icon-wrap">
            {% if c.image %}
              <img src="{{ c.image | relative_url }}" alt="{{ c.title }}" class="countries-strip-image">
            {% else %}
              <span class="countries-strip-placeholder">{{ c.title | slice: 0, 1 }}</span>
            {% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="countries-strip-label">{{ c.title }}</span>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
